        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL-101-105.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH101-STANDARDS-QUAL-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH102-ZK-CHALLENGE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH103-AST-SANDBOX-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH104-SAAT-COMPENSATE-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH105-MESH-PARITY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL-WITNESS       PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH101-STANDARDS-QUAL-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH102-ZK-CHALLENGE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH103-AST-SANDBOX-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH104-SAAT-COMPENSATE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH105-MESH-PARITY-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUAL-WITNESS.
